WEBVTT

1
00:49:49.642 --> 00:49:55.642
Are there people here in Open Church for the first time today?

2
00:49:55.642 --> 00:49:59.642
Give them a wave if you are a guest in Open Church.

3
00:49:59.642 --> 00:50:04.642
No one? Oh, there is someone. Someone in the back for the first time. Can I get a round of applause?

4
00:50:09.642 --> 00:50:17.642
May I ask, were you invited by someone from Open Church or did you come on your own?

5
00:50:18.642 --> 00:50:19.642
Yes.

6
00:50:24.642 --> 00:50:25.642
Wow.

7
00:50:28.642 --> 00:50:30.642
Did you already know Jesus beforehand?

8
00:50:33.642 --> 00:50:34.642
Yes.

9
00:50:41.642 --> 00:50:42.642
Yes.

10
00:50:43.642 --> 00:50:49.642
No. Really. Praise the Lord. Praise the Lord.

11
00:50:52.642 --> 00:50:57.642
So I can just call you my sister. I have also found comfort in this Word.

12
00:50:57.642 --> 00:51:01.642
It is God's Word, it is stable, it is the rock on which we stand. Amen.

13
00:51:02.642 --> 00:51:04.642
Wow, she rode by on her bike.

14
00:51:06.642 --> 00:51:09.642
I really think that's cool. What an encouragement.

15
00:51:10.642 --> 00:51:18.642
Speaking of encouragements, I just want to say, in the last few weeks I have received a lot of encouragements and support from people.

16
00:51:18.642 --> 00:51:23.642
Not that I am fishing for it, I just want to thank everyone for that.

17
00:51:23.642 --> 00:51:28.642
I want to thank everyone for the wonderful unity that is in Open Church.

18
00:51:28.642 --> 00:51:37.642
When I am reading the letters to the Philippians, I think, Paul, you should visit Open Church, because we are also a unity.

19
00:51:37.642 --> 00:51:41.642
We all look to Jesus. Amen. And we love him. Amen.

20
00:51:41.642 --> 00:51:46.642
And there is enthusiasm. Amen. We love him. Hallelujah.

21
00:51:46.642 --> 00:52:00.642
And when I, yes, last week when we were talking about testimonies, I was preparing myself for last week's service.

22
00:52:00.642 --> 00:52:12.642
And I wanted to ask Randolph and Maureen, that was last week, I wanted to ask them, would you please come up on stage to share a few words with us?

23
00:52:12.642 --> 00:52:27.642
And then I thought to myself, there are the thought processes, on the one hand I am greatly impressed with your faith and your determination in Christ and I believe that should be made public.

24
00:52:27.642 --> 00:52:40.642
And so I wanted to ask you last week, come up on stage to share a few words with us, to bless us as a church with who you are and how you are standing in your life at this moment.

25
00:52:40.642 --> 00:52:53.642
And then the next thought was, yes, but I also want to leave people alone, because you know, there are moments of laughter and there are moments of crying, there are moments of fighting and there are moments of mourning.

26
00:52:54.642 --> 00:53:04.642
And I thought to myself, maybe not yet, because there is also a time when I just want to let you rest a bit and not expose people immediately.

27
00:53:04.642 --> 00:53:12.642
And the funny thing was, that thought process last week was that I wanted to ask you to share a few words with us.

28
00:53:12.642 --> 00:53:21.642
And this week I heard that you, last week or this week, said that you wanted to say a few words yourselves.

29
00:53:21.642 --> 00:53:33.642
And I think that’s really great, so I would like to invite you up on stage. Come over here and share a few words with us, because we want to honor you, for sure.

30
00:53:34.642 --> 00:53:40.642
Randolph Maureen, would you like to speak in English, then Chris will translate, or would you like to speak in Dutch?

31
00:53:40.642 --> 00:53:45.642
In English? Okay. Chris, can you translate then, please?

32
00:54:03.642 --> 00:54:11.642
Hallelujah! Hallelujah! Hallelujah! Hallelujah!

33
00:54:11.642 --> 00:54:17.642
Our God is good. He is a faithful God.

34
00:54:17.642 --> 00:54:24.642
The Bible says that He is always present.

35
00:54:24.642 --> 00:54:31.642
And that we can experience His presence in our lives.

36
00:54:31.642 --> 00:54:44.642
From the pregnancy to the death of Shiloh, He was there.

37
00:54:44.642 --> 00:54:51.642
All those negative words, all those, yes, I don't want to go into the details.

38
00:54:51.642 --> 00:54:58.642
We just had one response back to the doctors.

39
00:54:58.642 --> 00:55:06.642
We choose to stand in Jesus.

40
00:55:06.642 --> 00:55:18.642
And that is why we are here to encourage you, whatever circumstance you are in,

41
00:55:18.642 --> 00:55:24.642
even if you see no way out yourself.

42
00:55:24.642 --> 00:55:28.642
Stand before Jesus.

43
00:55:28.642 --> 00:55:33.642
He will never forsake you.

44
00:55:33.642 --> 00:55:44.642
And through this period, we have experienced His love, His encouragement, His provision.

45
00:55:44.642 --> 00:55:53.642
We have experienced God in a dimension we have never experienced before.

46
00:55:53.642 --> 00:55:57.642
And that is why we stand here to say thank You, Lord.

47
00:55:57.642 --> 00:56:01.642
And we also thank the church.

48
00:56:01.642 --> 00:56:06.642
We thank everyone who has prayed for us.

49
00:56:06.642 --> 00:56:12.642
And those who have surrounded us with love.

50
00:56:12.642 --> 00:56:20.642
Our brothers and fathers are not here,

51
00:56:20.642 --> 00:56:28.642
but we have brothers, fathers, and sisters here.

52
00:56:28.642 --> 00:56:31.642
And only Jesus can do that for you.

53
00:56:31.642 --> 00:56:34.642
So all glory is for Him.

54
00:56:35.642 --> 00:56:43.642
It is a time of trouble, but we praise God.

55
00:56:48.642 --> 00:56:53.642
Yes, for it is a loss,

56
00:56:53.642 --> 00:56:58.642
but at the same time, it is also a gain.

57
00:56:58.642 --> 00:57:02.642
And glory to the Most High God.

58
00:57:04.642 --> 00:57:07.642
I have nothing to add to this.

59
00:57:07.642 --> 00:57:09.642
She has said it all.

60
00:57:09.642 --> 00:57:11.642
We did not plan for you to say everything.

61
00:57:11.642 --> 00:57:13.642
I think I need to say a bit more.

62
00:57:13.642 --> 00:57:15.642
You have said everything I wanted to say.

63
00:57:15.642 --> 00:57:17.642
I just want to thank God.

64
00:57:17.642 --> 00:57:19.642
And I thank the church.

65
00:57:19.642 --> 00:57:21.642
Thank you.

66
00:57:21.642 --> 00:57:23.642
Thank you.

67
00:57:23.642 --> 00:57:25.642
Thank you.

68
00:57:25.642 --> 00:57:27.642
Thank you.

69
00:57:27.642 --> 00:57:29.642
Thank you.

70
00:57:29.642 --> 00:57:31.642
Thank you.

71
00:57:31.642 --> 00:57:33.642
Thank you.

72
00:57:34.642 --> 00:57:36.642
I just want to thank God.

73
00:57:38.642 --> 00:57:41.642
The Bible says to thank the Lord in all circumstances.

74
00:57:41.642 --> 00:57:43.642
In everything, you know.

75
00:57:44.642 --> 00:57:47.642
It does not say good or bad, it says everything.

76
00:57:49.642 --> 00:57:51.642
And in God, there is nothing bad.

77
00:57:54.642 --> 00:57:58.642
We say bad, it is bad, but with God, it is not so.

78
00:57:58.642 --> 00:58:01.642
For in the light, all darkness will flee.

79
00:58:05.642 --> 00:58:08.642
We give glory to Him, for He was so wonderful.

80
00:58:09.642 --> 00:58:12.642
I thank the church and everyone here.

81
00:58:14.642 --> 00:58:17.642
Yesterday we opened the envelopes.

82
00:58:17.642 --> 00:58:19.642
I said to my wife.

83
00:58:19.642 --> 00:58:21.642
How can I thank you?

84
00:58:21.642 --> 00:58:24.642
As I start sending letters to people.

85
00:58:24.642 --> 00:58:26.642
I don't know.

86
00:58:32.642 --> 00:58:37.642
We have food, money, everything.

87
00:58:39.642 --> 00:58:43.642
We have received transportation.

88
00:58:43.642 --> 00:58:48.642
It was all really amazing, too much. Thank you.

89
00:58:50.642 --> 00:58:52.642
We never thought about that.

90
00:58:54.642 --> 00:58:57.642
But because He lives, that is why we can confess this.

91
00:59:02.642 --> 00:59:06.642
And we are here to thank Him for everything He has done.

92
00:59:08.642 --> 00:59:11.642
We have healed the ten people with leprosy.

93
00:59:14.642 --> 00:59:17.642
And they went away.

94
00:59:18.642 --> 00:59:21.642
And only one who was healed came back.

95
00:59:22.642 --> 00:59:25.642
That is a lesson for us, to always give thanks.

96
00:59:25.642 --> 00:59:27.642
That is why we are here.

97
00:59:27.642 --> 00:59:29.642
To thank Him, Father.

98
00:59:29.642 --> 00:59:32.642
And to tell the people who have done everything for us.

99
00:59:32.642 --> 00:59:34.642
Thank you.

100
00:59:34.642 --> 00:59:36.642
We come back to thank Him.

101
00:59:36.642 --> 00:59:38.642
But also to thank all of you.

102
00:59:38.642 --> 00:59:39.642
Praise the Lord.

103
00:59:39.642 --> 00:59:42.642
I will not let you go until you have prayed for us.

104
00:59:42.642 --> 00:59:44.642
You must pray for us.

105
00:59:44.642 --> 00:59:45.642
Can we stand up?

106
00:59:45.642 --> 00:59:51.642
I would appreciate it if our brother and sister could pray for us.

107
00:59:51.642 --> 00:59:55.642
That our faith may be strengthened.

108
00:59:55.642 --> 01:00:02.642
You just heard him say, in every situation recognize the Lord.

109
01:00:02.642 --> 01:00:05.642
If you are successful, do not forget the Lord.

110
01:00:07.642 --> 01:00:11.642
If you are in trouble, recognize the Lord in all your ways.

111
01:00:13.642 --> 01:00:20.642
So in whatever situation, I would appreciate it if you could say a prayer over us.

112
01:00:20.642 --> 01:00:22.642
To strengthen our faith in Jesus.

113
01:00:22.642 --> 01:00:29.642
Before I pray, I want to say a prayer over us.

114
01:00:29.642 --> 01:00:33.642
Before I pray, I want to tell a short story.

115
01:00:33.642 --> 01:00:35.642
It is really a short story.

116
01:00:35.642 --> 01:00:37.642
Or a reminder for all of us.

117
01:00:39.642 --> 01:00:46.642
When we gave our lives to the Lord, the pastor was given a message from the Lord.

118
01:00:46.642 --> 01:00:51.642
When he had given his life to the Lord, the pastor was given a message from the Lord.

119
01:00:53.642 --> 01:00:56.642
It was about someone who had no shoes.

120
01:00:56.642 --> 01:00:59.642
When he came to the church, it was time to thank God.

121
01:00:59.642 --> 01:01:02.642
He always shouted Hallelujah, Hallelujah.

122
01:01:02.642 --> 01:01:08.642
But there was another rich man, whose Hallelujah was given to the Lord.

123
01:01:16.642 --> 01:01:24.642
The rich man said, I will buy shoes for you.

124
01:01:25.642 --> 01:01:28.642
But then just stop saying Hallelujah.

125
01:01:29.642 --> 01:01:31.642
He said, that's fine.

126
01:01:34.642 --> 01:01:36.642
But his spirit could not accept that.

127
01:01:40.642 --> 01:01:43.642
The first Sunday he came, no Hallelujah.

128
01:01:45.642 --> 01:01:47.642
The second Sunday, again no Hallelujah.

129
01:01:48.642 --> 01:01:50.642
And then it burst forth.

130
01:01:55.642 --> 01:01:57.642
With or without shoes, praise the Lord.

131
01:01:59.642 --> 01:02:01.642
And for me, today, that lesson is,

132
01:02:05.642 --> 01:02:07.642
whether you have money or no money,

133
01:02:08.642 --> 01:02:10.642
health or no health,

134
01:02:11.642 --> 01:02:13.642
what we need,

135
01:02:14.642 --> 01:02:15.642
without those things,

136
01:02:16.642 --> 01:02:17.642
or with those things,

137
01:02:18.642 --> 01:02:21.642
praise the name of the Most High God.

138
01:02:24.642 --> 01:02:25.642
Father, we thank You.

139
01:02:29.642 --> 01:02:31.642
For all our brothers and sisters who are gathered here together.

140
01:02:34.642 --> 01:02:37.642
We pray and present our hearts to You, Father.

141
01:02:40.642 --> 01:02:41.642
That you make us steadfast.

142
01:02:45.642 --> 01:02:47.642
That you help us to look at both circumstances.

143
01:02:50.642 --> 01:02:52.642
Open our eyes to see your glory.

144
01:02:55.642 --> 01:02:59.642
That we understand that the life we live is from you and not from us.

145
01:03:03.642 --> 01:03:06.642
It is by your grace that we can live every day again.

146
01:03:09.642 --> 01:03:12.642
And we give our lives to glorify your holy name.

147
01:03:15.642 --> 01:03:16.642
And at the end,

148
01:03:19.642 --> 01:03:21.642
you say welcome home, my child.

149
01:03:22.642 --> 01:03:23.642
Well done.

150
01:03:24.642 --> 01:03:27.642
Walk with us, Father, step by step, as you always have been.

151
01:03:31.642 --> 01:03:33.642
Strengthen us where we are weak.

152
01:03:34.642 --> 01:03:37.642
And make a way for us where there seems to be no way.

153
01:03:41.642 --> 01:03:43.642
Pour out your spirit upon us, Father.

154
01:03:45.642 --> 01:03:47.642
Strengthen our mortal body.

155
01:03:50.642 --> 01:03:52.642
Strengthen our mortal body.

156
01:03:52.642 --> 01:03:54.642
Make us alive again from within.

157
01:03:58.642 --> 01:03:59.642
In Jesus' mighty name.

158
01:04:01.642 --> 01:04:02.642
Thank you, Father.

159
01:04:10.642 --> 01:04:12.642
Father, we give you the glory.

160
01:04:14.642 --> 01:04:16.642
There is nothing that compares to you.

161
01:04:18.642 --> 01:04:19.642
You are so holy.

162
01:04:22.642 --> 01:04:24.642
You are so faithful and just.

163
01:04:26.642 --> 01:04:28.642
You are so loving and glorious, Father.

164
01:04:32.642 --> 01:04:35.642
Father, we thank you today for everyone who is present here.

165
01:04:37.642 --> 01:04:40.642
Father, if there is anything we want to ask for more,

166
01:04:41.642 --> 01:04:43.642
it is your spirit upon our lives.

167
01:04:47.642 --> 01:04:50.642
Father, without your spirit we can do nothing.

168
01:04:53.642 --> 01:04:56.642
Father, without your spirit we can do nothing.

169
01:04:58.642 --> 01:05:02.642
The Bible says that it is not by might, but by your spirit.

170
01:05:07.642 --> 01:05:10.642
We thank you for all the good things you do.

171
01:05:12.642 --> 01:05:15.642
Father, we enjoy doing good things.

172
01:05:18.642 --> 01:05:20.642
Father, our flesh is weak.

173
01:05:20.642 --> 01:05:22.642
Father, our flesh is weak.

174
01:05:25.642 --> 01:05:28.642
And that is why we ask you to refresh our hearts.

175
01:05:34.642 --> 01:05:37.642
And we ask you to work through us.

176
01:05:43.642 --> 01:05:47.642
And without your Holy Spirit we are limited to make progress.

177
01:05:50.642 --> 01:05:54.642
Father, I have seen many people who said they were so happy.

178
01:05:55.642 --> 01:05:58.642
Father, I give you the glory for all those people.

179
01:06:09.642 --> 01:06:13.642
Father, we pray for a manifestation of your power in the name of our Lord Jesus Christ.

180
01:06:15.642 --> 01:06:19.642
Father, we want a manifestation of your power in the name of our Lord Jesus Christ.

181
01:06:21.642 --> 01:06:26.642
Father, you said that if we ask anything in the name of our Lord Jesus Christ, then you will give it to us.

182
01:06:30.642 --> 01:06:36.642
Father, we ask that your spirit manifests here in the powerful name of our Lord Jesus Christ.

183
01:06:39.642 --> 01:06:43.642
Father, let your spirit change here as we have never seen before.

184
01:06:46.642 --> 01:06:49.642
Father, let your spirit change here, in these premises.

185
01:06:50.642 --> 01:06:54.642
Father, let lives be transformed, for the glory of your holy name.

186
01:06:58.642 --> 01:07:02.642
Father, we bless the pastors and the elders of the church.

187
01:07:07.642 --> 01:07:10.642
With wisdom that can only come from you.

188
01:07:14.642 --> 01:07:17.642
To be able to lead this large group of people.

189
01:07:17.642 --> 01:07:18.642
Thank you, Father.

190
01:07:21.642 --> 01:07:24.642
For everything we ask in your name, that you also give it.

191
01:07:26.642 --> 01:07:27.642
In Jesus' name we ask this.

192
01:07:28.642 --> 01:07:29.642
Amen.

193
01:07:31.642 --> 01:07:32.642
Thank you very much.

194
01:07:32.642 --> 01:07:33.642
Thank you very much.

195
01:08:02.642 --> 01:08:09.642
We know that a few weeks ago there was a collection for Tycoon Global in Jerusalem.

196
01:08:10.642 --> 01:08:12.642
And Vanessa will of course share something about that.

197
01:08:32.642 --> 01:08:33.642
Okay, thank you very much.

198
01:08:34.642 --> 01:08:43.642
Okay, we were able to convert 10,748 euros to Tycoon Global in the week.

199
01:08:49.642 --> 01:08:50.642
Amen.

200
01:08:50.642 --> 01:08:51.642
Thank you, Lord.

201
01:08:51.642 --> 01:08:54.642
Thank you for giving the ministry happiness.

202
01:08:56.642 --> 01:08:57.642
Wow, am I waiting?

203
01:08:57.642 --> 01:08:58.642
Or shall I continue?

204
01:09:00.642 --> 01:09:01.642
I don't have much more to say.

205
01:09:01.642 --> 01:09:02.642
I am drumming.

206
01:09:02.642 --> 01:09:05.642
So, Lord, we simply give you thanks.

207
01:09:06.642 --> 01:09:11.642
I am grateful for a house that we receive revelation that we have given so much.

208
01:09:12.642 --> 01:09:13.642
We have given so much.

209
01:09:14.642 --> 01:09:16.642
And we can give freely and generously.

210
01:09:17.642 --> 01:09:20.642
And we can give with an abundant heart of thanksgiving.

211
01:09:21.642 --> 01:09:29.642
So, Lord, I just mean that you would continue to enlighten our hearts, our minds, and our spirits, Lord.

212
01:09:29.642 --> 01:09:30.642
To be generous.

213
01:09:30.642 --> 01:09:35.642
For we who have given so much, so much is needed, so much is expected.

214
01:09:35.642 --> 01:09:37.642
The Lord has good things for this house.

215
01:09:37.642 --> 01:09:41.642
But as we break out, He says, I will break out even more.

216
01:09:41.642 --> 01:09:45.642
And so, Lord, we simply thank you for the spiritual blessing.

217
01:09:45.642 --> 01:09:47.642
Just like what Randolph and Maureen thought of.

218
01:09:47.642 --> 01:09:53.642
There is spiritual food and spiritual revelation that you give us as we sow.

219
01:09:53.642 --> 01:09:55.642
As we sow happily.

220
01:09:55.642 --> 01:09:56.642
Thank you, Lord.

221
01:09:56.642 --> 01:09:57.642
Thank you, Lord.

222
01:09:57.642 --> 01:10:00.642
So I would just say, this morning we would establish our own house.

223
01:10:00.642 --> 01:10:01.642
Amen.

224
01:10:02.642 --> 01:10:03.642
Let us be happy.

225
01:10:03.642 --> 01:10:11.642
If this is your house, if this is where the Lord has planted you, you know, Tim and I, we do not make anyone stay.

226
01:10:12.642 --> 01:10:13.642
Amen.

227
01:10:13.642 --> 01:10:16.642
We do not suspect people to stay, we do not suspect people to come.

228
01:10:16.642 --> 01:10:20.642
The better is if you know that the Lord has planted you.

229
01:10:22.642 --> 01:10:23.642
Amen.

230
01:10:24.642 --> 01:10:25.642
Amen.

231
01:10:26.642 --> 01:10:32.642
And if you know, what I want to say is, if you know that the Lord has planted you.

232
01:10:34.642 --> 01:10:36.642
Then you feel like an owner.

233
01:10:37.642 --> 01:10:40.642
Then you feel responsible.

234
01:10:41.642 --> 01:10:43.642
At least, that is what we should feel.

235
01:10:43.642 --> 01:10:46.642
Because it is not just their house.

236
01:10:47.642 --> 01:10:50.642
Oh, they are up there and they might be next to me, but not I.

237
01:10:50.642 --> 01:11:04.642
No, if the Lord plants you in a family, then you grow up and start serving in the family.

238
01:11:04.642 --> 01:11:07.642
And we serve God by serving each other.

239
01:11:07.642 --> 01:11:08.642
Amen.

240
01:11:08.642 --> 01:11:13.642
So it is a blessing to be able to give.

241
01:11:13.642 --> 01:11:19.642
So Lord, everything you have given us is not ours.

242
01:11:19.642 --> 01:11:21.642
And we recognize that as well.

243
01:11:22.642 --> 01:11:26.642
That we are stewards of what you desire.

244
01:11:26.642 --> 01:11:29.642
That life is entrusted to us by you.

245
01:11:32.642 --> 01:11:34.642
And I thank you that this house is full.

246
01:11:35.642 --> 01:11:37.642
And that there is an abundance.

